+/*
+ * COLVOL_TYPE_POLYGON: trace the piece's real triangles.
+ *
+ * pi0/pi1 arrive in piece-local space (IntersectPiecesHelper builds the
+ * matrix as m * lmp->GetModelSpaceMatrix(), and InitShape() forces this
